  "task": "Actual public event records Eli typing the specific household proposal, marking later payments awaiting Sunday and tapping Send. Independently confirm warranted household-record or communication consequences, or refrain. No bank transfer, supplier contact or future affordability is established; no new deadline or obstacle. Save world JSON kind world, director timing, decision, proposal, reason, changes, percepts. Percept schema precisely [{to:[public|mara|eli],text:...}]. Preserve quoted record scope and distinguish an attempted/sent note from an agreed later plan.",
